cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this
  file.
title: SymBro
abstract: >-
  A CLI/pipeline for symmetry-broken protein cage design, covering the
  full pipeline end to end: RCSB query (or your own local structure
  files), download, symmetry-ring geometry analysis, ring subunit
  isolation, RFdiffusion, ProteinMPNN, structure-prediction screening
  (self-consistency RMSD/pLDDT), and codon-optimized, orderable DNA
  sequences.
type: software
authors:
